From: Kreijstal <rainb@tfwno.gf>
Subject: [PATCH] uflvplayer: do not embed the prebuilt Flash SWF players under FPC

flvplayer.RES only carries two compiled Flash movies (FLVPLAYER and
NETPLAYER RCDATA) for the Adobe Flash ActiveX control.  The Free Pascal
build replaces that control with a stub whose constructor raises
EFlashUnavailable (fpc/ShockwaveEx_fpc.inc), so the movies can never be
played.  Do not link the prebuilt binaries into Ares.exe; init_flv_player
and the net player already bail out when the resource is missing.
---
--- a/uflvplayer.pas
+++ b/uflvplayer.pas
@@ -43,7 +43,9 @@
 
 implementation
 
+{$IFNDEF FPC}
 {$R flvplayer.res}
+{$ENDIF} // FPC: no Flash ActiveX (see fpc/ShockwaveEx_fpc.inc), so the prebuilt SWF players are not embedded
 
 uses
  umediar,helper_diskio,vars_global,ufrmmain,ares_types,helper_strings,
